sec.p:
The number of teams and potential authorships varies considerably across people in the sample. To ensure that our estimates are not dominated by people who are on many teams or on teams with many articles, we weight our data so that each person receives equal weight and for each person, each team receives equal weight. If \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
