				\begin{document}$$\frac{1}{{N}_{{Teams},i}\cdot {N}_{{PA},t}}$$\end{document}1NTeams,i⋅NPA,t. Thus, each person is weighted by the inverse of the number of teams on which he or she appears times the inverse number of potential authorships for that team. Each unique employee therefore has an overall weight of one in the sample. Our results, however, are robust to various alternative weightings.

